r8169-dkms (7.0.0.41.41+2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Driver base: drivers/net/ethernet/realtek from Ubuntu kernel tag
    Ubuntu-7.0.0-41.41 (7bae00f0ec4a) with the Proxmox VE kernel's r8169
    patches (pve-kernel 803fe655, Proxmox bug #8110): Ubuntu's linux-next
    phylink series is reverted, as in 7.0.14-22-pve and later.
  * Fixes and device support from mainline Linux:
    - r8169: add support for RTL8125cp (a90e3029f20d)
    - r8169: give RTL_GIGA_MAC_VER_EXTENDED a distinct value (d77f3f016826)
    - r8169: keep LED device name valid after setup (3f33a2d2ea92)
  * Fixes from the Linux stable trees:
    - r8169: disable EEE on RTL8168h/8111h
      (linux-7.2.y c5c096b13445, upstream 3cdeaef1754a)
  * Only built for Proxmox 7.0 kernels from 7.0.14-22-pve on.

